{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10132060","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10132060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1013206001:0":{"text":"ど、どうしましょう！あの子に何かあったんじゃ！？","source_cn":"怎么办，怎么办？她不会遇到什么危险吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB2822F33725483A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013206002:1":{"text":"メリス、フィーを探しに行ってくれる？こんなことなら彼女と一緒に行動するんだったわ……","source_cn":"梅瑞特，你能去找找她吗？唉……早知道我就陪着她了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10B17748A81DCFA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1013206002":{"text":"メリス、フィーを探しに行ってくれる？こんなことなら彼女と一緒に行動するんだったわ……","source_cn":"梅瑞特，你能去找找她吗？唉……早知道我就陪着她了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10B17748A81DCFA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013206003:1":{"text":"強いて言うなら……フィーは宝石を感知する能力があるの。本当に羨ましい能力で――","source_cn":"非要说的话，菲对宝石有一定的感应能力，这还挺令人羡慕的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD6BFEB8608249FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013206004:1":{"text":"話がそれてるぞ、学者のお嬢さん。","source_cn":"这位学者小姐，不要跑题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA866F0BED511C3AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document